pages['experience']=('Experience Hemp',section('AN INTEGRATED HEMP FARM & IMMERSIVE LIVING EXPERIENCE','From the plant.<br>To the walls.<br>To the way we live.','Discover hemp through a place you can inhabit: an ancestral Himalayan home where materials, everyday comfort and village life become part of the same story.')+f'<div class="wide wrap"><img src="/assets/quiet-exterior.webp" alt="Stone and natural materials of the ancestral Himalayan home" loading="lazy"></div>'+vision+segments+'''<section class="faq wrap"><h2>Curiosity, at your own pace.</h2><details open><summary>What can I experience now?</summary><p>Book a stay in the house and ask the hosts to arrange a conversation about its hempcrete construction and natural materials. Agree any guided time, fees and inclusions before booking.</p></details><details><summary>Are farm walks and the Experience Center open?</summary><p>They are part of our next chapter and are not yet offered as confirmed visitor facilities. Ask about progress and seasonal opportunities when planning your dates.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to join activities?</summary><p>No. Quiet leisure stays remain at the heart of the home. You can simply enjoy the mountains, read and rest. Learning sessions and group activities are arranged separately.</p></details></section>''')
builder='''<section class="builder-stay wrap" id="builder-stay"><p class="eyebrow">2–3 NIGHTS · BY ARRANGEMENT</p><h2>Live Before You Build.</h2><p class="lead">Before you choose a material for your own home, spend a little time living with it.</p><div class="hemp-path-grid"><article><span class="eyebrow">ARRIVE &amp; OBSERVE</span><h3>Feel the room.</h3><p>Spend a day and night in the house. Notice the light, ventilation, surfaces and your own sense of comfort in the season you visit.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">LOOK CLOSER</span><h3>Ask better questions.</h3><p>Arrange a materials conversation with the hosts: construction choices, finishes, maintenance and what they would approach differently.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">TAKE IT FORWARD</span><h3>Shape your next step.</h3><p>Discuss your location, project stage and priorities. Ask about the GoHemp connection and appropriate technical contacts for further advice.</p></article></div><p>Share your dates and project brief for a tailored proposal. Accommodation, meals, guided time and any consultation charges will be confirmed individually.</p>'''+enquiry_link('Hello, I am interested in a 2–3 night Live Before You Build stay. My preferred dates, guest count, project location and project stage are:','Enquire about a builder stay ↗')+'''<p class="small-print">A trial stay offers first-hand observations, not a performance guarantee. Comfort varies with weather, design and use; project-specific construction advice requires a separate assessment.</p></section>'''
